<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $65-5/8.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR OPENS AT $65-5/8.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $0-1/8 at $65-5/8 in New York on Friday, and rose further to $65-3/4.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 324.48 markka.</p>
<p>--- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
